## Stack

- Next.js 15 (App Router, RSC, typedRoutes)
- Supabase (Postgres + Auth + Storage)
- Stripe (test mode by default; production on env switch)
- Sentry + PostHog (privacy-masked defaults)
- TypeScript strict + `exactOptionalPropertyTypes` + `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`

## Local dev

```bash
cp .env.example .env.local      # fill in Supabase + Stripe + Sentry keys
pnpm install
pnpm dev                        # http://localhost:3000
```

## Database setup

```bash
pnpm dlx supabase init           # if not already
pnpm dlx supabase start          # local Postgres
pnpm dlx supabase db push        # apply migrations from supabase/migrations/
```

## Deploy

Vercel: push the `main` branch. The `vercel.json` ships build/install commands and pins region `iad1`.

Supabase: link the project (`supabase link --project-ref <ref>`) and run `supabase db push` against staging before promoting.

